    "mnemonic": "This is a single kanji with an <ja>い</ja> on the end, meaning you know it's probably an adjective. What's the adjective form of <kanji>lazy</kanji>? It's <vocabulary>sluggish</vocabulary> and <vocabulary>dull</vocabulary>. ",
